  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mythical_0-Reconsideration of human
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - The Andromeda course! I thought it was only a myth!
  - "It\u2019s incredible, human, that you have made it this far. I apologize, I
    was wrong about your incompetence. You have proved your species possesses formidable
    golfing talent, maybe even surpassing even that of my creators."
  - Now, you have discovered legendary Andromeda golf course. It is rumoured that
    here, the Caddi invented the Universal Drive. A drive would that allow multiversal
    travel to other golf courses.
  - Yet you must be cautious, quasars are everywhere in this galaxy and their powerful
    X-Rays will fry your golf ball within seconds.
  - "Complete this galaxy however, and I may be able to unveil the secrets of the
    Universe Drive\u2026"
  revealNameLater: 0
  hiddenSpeakerName: 
